This is a ComfyUI adaptation of LynnReal-AI/LynnReal-Omni, reviewed at
f6ee8b8ecfeafa354a56d91b27a530ac8897d8d8.

flash.py adapts the upstream token selection and restoration implementation to
ComfyUI ModelPatcher block replacements. quantization.py adapts the released
W8A8 arithmetic to ComfyUI-managed weight operations. The other runtime files
implement ComfyUI node interfaces, local checkpoint conversion, conditioning,
native sampling, continuation, and codec integration. These are modified/new
integration files, not verbatim copies of the upstream inference pipeline.

